<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Sakaria</para>
  <para style="toc1">Odiyifoɔ Sakaria Nwoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sakaria</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Odiyifoɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sakaria</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nwoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1"/>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Nkyɛn Ba Ho Frɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1"/>Ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so nwɔtwe wɔ ɔhene Dario adedie afe a ɛtɔ so mmienu mu no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa odiyifoɔ Sakaria a ɔyɛ Berekia babarima na ɔno nso yɛ Ido babarima nkyɛn sɛ:<verse eid="ZEC 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu mo tete agyanom. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3"/>Enti, ka kyerɛ nkurɔfoɔ no sɛ: Sei na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Monsane mmra me nkyɛn, na mɛsane aba mo nkyɛn,’ deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4"/>Monnyɛ sɛ mo tete agyanom, a adiyifoɔ a wɔdii ɛkan no pae mu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Sei na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Monnane mfiri mo akwammɔne ne nneyɛeɛ bɔne ho,’ nanso wɔantie no na wɔanyɛ aso amma no. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5"/>Mo tete agyanom wɔ he seesei? Na adiyifoɔ no, wɔte ase daa anaa? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6"/>Na me nsɛm a menam mʼasomfoɔ adiyifoɔ so kaeɛ no, amma mo tete agyanom no so anaa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:6">“Afei wɔnuu wɔn ho na wɔkaa sɛ, ‘Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ yɛn deɛ ɛfata yɛn akwan ne nneyɛeɛ, sɛdeɛ ɔyɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔbɛyɛ no.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onipa A Ɔwɔ Ohwam Nnua No Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7"/>Na ɛda a ɛtɔ so aduonu ɛnan wɔ ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so dubaako a wɔfrɛ no Sebat, wɔ ɔhene Dario adedie afe a ɛtɔ so mmienu so no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa odiyifoɔ Sakaria a ɔyɛ Ido babarima Berekia babarima no nkyɛn.<verse eid="ZEC 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8"/>Anadwo no menyaa anisoadehunu, mehunuu ɔbarima bi a ɔte ɔpɔnkɔ kɔkɔɔ so wɔ mʼanim! Na ɔgyina ohwam nnua bi ntam wɔ bɔnhwa tiaa a emu dɔ mu. Na apɔnkɔ kɔkɔɔ, nnodoeɛ ne fitaa wɔ nʼakyi.<verse eid="ZEC 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9"/>Mebisaa sɛ, “Yeinom ase ne sɛn, me wura?” Ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔne me rekasa no buaa sɛ, “Mɛkyerɛ wo adekodeɛ a wɔyɛ.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10"/>Enti, ɔbarima a ɔgyina ohwam nnua ntam mu no kyerɛɛ aseɛ sɛ, “Wɔyɛ wɔn a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asoma wɔn sɛ wɔnkɔ ewiase afanan nyinaa no.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11"/>Na wɔbɛka kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔgyina ohwam nnua no mu no sɛ, “Yɛakyin afa asase no so nyinaa, na yɛhunuu sɛ ewiase nyinaa wɔ ahomegyeɛ ne asomdwoeɛ.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no kaa sɛ, “Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ɛnkɔsi da bɛn na wobɛyi wʼahummɔborɔ afiri Yerusalem ne Yuda nkuro a wo bo afu wɔn mfirinhyia aduɔson yi so?” <verse eid="ZEC 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13"/>Enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa abodwosɛm ne awerɛkyekyesɛm kyerɛɛ ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔne me kasaeɛ no.<verse eid="ZEC 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14"/>Afei ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔne me rekasa no kaa sɛ, “Pae mu ka saa asɛm yi: Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Metwe Yerusalem ne Sion ho ninkunu yie, <verse eid="ZEC 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15"/>nanso, me bo afu aman a wɔn aso mu adwo wɔn no. Na anka me bo mfu wɔn bebree, nanso wɔmaa Israel amanehunu no boroo so.’<verse eid="ZEC 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16"/>“Enti, deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: ‘Mɛsane abɛhunu Yerusalem mmɔbɔ, na ɛhɔ na wɔbɛsane asi me fie. Na wɔbɛtwe susu ahoma mu wɔ Yerusalem so,’ deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="ZEC 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17"/>“Kɔ so pae mu ka sɛ, sei na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Nnepa bɛbu so wɔ me nkuro yi so bio, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛkyekye Sion werɛ bio, na wafa Yerusalem.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmɛn Ɛnan Ne Adwumfoɔ Ɛnan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18"/>Afei, memaa mʼani so, na mehunuu mmɛn ɛnan! <verse eid="ZEC 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19"/>Mebisaa ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔne me rekasa no sɛ, “Yeinom yɛ ɛdeɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19">Ɔbuaa me sɛ, “Saa mmɛn yi na ɛbɔɔ Yuda, Israel ne Yerusalem peteeɛ no.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ me adwumfoɔ ɛnan. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21"/>Mebisaa sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na yeinom rebɛyɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:21">Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Mmɛn ɛnan no bɔɔ Yuda petee a obiara antumi amma ne tiri so, nanso adwumfoɔ yi aba sɛ wɔrebɛhunahuna wɔn, na woatutu aman no mmɛn a wɔmemaa so tiaa Yudaman na wɔbɔɔ nnipa no peteeɛ no.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Onipa A Ɔkura Susuhoma No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1"/>Afei memaa mʼani so, na mehunuu ɔbarima bi a ɔkura susuhoma sɛ ɔgyina mʼanim! <verse eid="ZEC 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2"/>Mebisaa no sɛ, “Ɛhe na worekɔ?” Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Merekɔsusu Yerusalem, ahunu ne tɛtrɛtɛ ne ne tentene.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3"/>Na ɔbɔfoɔ a na ɔne me rekasa no kɔɔeɛ, na ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ bɛhyiaa no <verse eid="ZEC 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4"/>na ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Tu mmirika, ka kyerɛ saa aberanteɛ no sɛ, ‘Yerusalem bɛyɛ kuropɔn a ɛnni afasuo ɛsiane nnipa ne mmoa dodoɔ a wɔwɔ mu enti. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5"/>Na mʼankasa mɛyɛ ogya fasuo, atwa ho ahyia,’ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie, ‘na mayɛ ne mu animuonyam.’<verse eid="ZEC 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6"/>“Mommra! Mommra! Monnwane mfiri atifi asase no so,” sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie, “Na mahwete mo mu ama ɔsoro mframa ɛnan no,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="ZEC 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7"/>“Mommra, Ao Sion! Monnwane mo a mote Babilonia!” <verse eid="ZEC 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8"/>Ɛfiri sɛ sei na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ, “Onimuonyamfoɔ no asoma me akɔtia aman a wɔafo wo nneɛma no. Ɛfiri sɛ, deɛ ɔde ne nsa bɛka wo biara no de nsa aka AWURADE aniwa kosua. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9"/>Nokorɛm mɛma me nsa so de atia wɔn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔn nkoa bɛfom wɔn nneɛma. Na ɛbɛma woahunu sɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10"/>“Team na ma wʼani nnye, Ao, Ɔbabaa Sion. Ɛfiri sɛ, mereba, na mene mo bɛtena,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11"/>“Aman bebree bɛka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ho saa ɛda no na wɔabɛyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ. Me ne mo bɛtena, na mobɛhunu sɛ, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me mo nkyɛn. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛfa Yuda sɛ nʼagyapadeɛ wɔ asase kronkron no so, na ɔbɛfa Yerusalem bio. <verse eid="ZEC 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13"/>Monyɛ komm wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, adasamma nyinaa, ɛfiri sɛ wakanyane ne ho wɔ nʼatenaeɛ kronkron hɔ.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsɔfopanin Ntadeɛ A Ani Te</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1"/>Afei, ɔkyerɛɛ me ɔsɔfopanin Yosua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yosua: Onipa korɔ yi ara na wɔbɔ ne din Yesua wɔ Hebri kasa mu wɔ Ɛsra ne Nehemia nwoma mu. Ɛha no, edin no gyina hɔ ma nnebɔneyɛfoɔman Israel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 3:8-9">3.8-9</ref></char>).</char></note> a ɔgyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ anim, na Satan gyina ne nifa so rebɛbɔ no soboɔ. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Satan sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nka wʼanim, Satan! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a Yerusalem yɛ ne dea no nka wʼanim. Saa ɔbarima yi nyɛ gyentia a wɔatu afiri ogya mu anaa?”<verse eid="ZEC 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3"/>Na Yosua hyɛ ntadeɛ fi ɛberɛ a ɔgyina ɔbɔfoɔ no anim. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn a wɔgyinagyina nʼanim no sɛ, “Monnyi ne ho ntadeɛ fi no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 3:4">Afei ɔka kyerɛɛ Yosua sɛ, “Hwɛ, mayi wo bɔne afiri wo so, na mede ntadeɛ a ɛyɛ fɛ bɛhyɛ wo.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5"/>Afei, mekaa sɛ, “Momfa abotire a ani teɛ mmɔ ne ti.” Enti, wɔde abotire a ani teɛ bɔɔ no, na wɔhyɛɛ no atadeɛ, ɛberɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no gyina hɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ de saa akwankyerɛ yi maa Yosua: <verse eid="ZEC 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7"/>“Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Sɛ wobɛyɛ ɔsetie ama me na woayɛ mʼapɛdeɛ a, ɛnneɛ wobɛdi me fie so na woahwɛ mʼabannwa so, na mɛma wo baabi atena wɔ nnipa a wɔgyinagyina ha yi mu.<verse eid="ZEC 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8"/>“ ‘Tie, Ao ɔsɔfopanin Yosua, wo ne wo nkurɔfoɔ a wɔtete wʼanim yi, moyɛ nnipa a wɔgyina hɔ ma nneɛma a ɛrebɛsisi: Mede me ɔsomfoɔ, Dubaa, no bɛba. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9"/>Hwɛ, aboɔdenboɔ a mede asi Yosua anim! Ani nson na ɛtuatua saa ɛboɔ baako no ho, na mekrukyire atwerɛ bi wɔ so,’ sɛdeɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie, ‘na mede ɛda koro pɛ bɛpepa asase yi so bɔne.<verse eid="ZEC 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10"/>“ ‘Saa ɛda no mo mu biara bɛto nsa afrɛ ne yɔnko ne no akɔtena ne ngo dua ne borɔdɔma dua ase,’ sɛdeɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Sikakɔkɔɔ Kanea Dua Ne Ngo Nnua Mmienu No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔne me kasaeɛ no sanee nʼakyi bɛnyanee me, sɛdeɛ wɔnyane obi firi ne nna mu no. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2"/>Ɔbisaa me sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na wohunu yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:2">Mebuaa sɛ, “Mehunu kaneadua a wɔde sikakɔkɔɔ ayɛ a kuruwa si so, na nkanea nson a ebiara wɔ ne dorobɛn sisi so. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3"/>Bio, ngo nnua mmienu sisi ho, baako wɔ kuruwa no nifa so, ɛna baako nso wɔ ne benkum so.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4"/>Mebisaa ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔne me kasaeɛ no sɛ, “Yeinom yɛ ɛdeɛn, me wura?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5"/>Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Wonnim deɛ yeinom yɛ anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:5">Mekaa sɛ, “Dabi, me wura.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6"/>Enti ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Yei ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɔde rekɔma Serubabel: ‘Ɛnyɛ tumi so, na ɛnyɛ ahoɔden nso so, na mmom, ɛnam me Honhom so,’ sɛdeɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="ZEC 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7"/>“Woyɛ ɛdeɛn, Ao bepɔ kɛseɛ? Wobɛyɛ asase tamaa wɔ Serubabel anim. Afei ɔde aboɔ fɛfɛ no bɛba abɛhyia osebɔ sɛ, ‘Onyankopɔn nhyira so! Onyankopɔn nhyira so!’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn sɛ: <verse eid="ZEC 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9"/>“Ɛnam Serubabel nsa so na wɔtoo asɔredan yi fapem, na ɛnam ne nsa so na wɔbɛwie. Na mobɛhunu sɛ, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me mo nkyɛn.<verse eid="ZEC 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10"/>“Hwan na ɔbu nneɛma nketenkete mfiaseɛ ɛda animtiaa? Sɛ nnipa hunu sɛ Serubabel kura kyirebenn susu ahoma no a, wɔn ani bɛgye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:10">“(Saa ani nson yi yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani a ɛhwɛ ewiase afanan nyinaa.)”<verse eid="ZEC 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11"/>Na mebisaa ɔbɔfoɔ no sɛ, “Saa ngo nnua mmienu no a ɛsisi kanea dua no nifa ne benkum no yɛ ɛdeɛn?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12"/>Na mebisaa no bio sɛ, “Ngodua mman mmienu a ɛhwie ngo a ani yɛ akokɔsradeɛ fa sikakɔkɔɔ dorobɛn mmienu no mu no yɛ ɛdeɛn?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13"/>Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Enti wonnim deɛ yeinom yɛ anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:13">Mebuaa sɛ, “Dabi, me wura.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14"/>Nti ɔkaa sɛ, “Yeinom ne mmienu a wɔasra wɔn ngo sɛ wɔnsom Awurade a ɔdi ewiase nyinaa so.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Nwoma Mmobɔeɛ A Ɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1"/>Mehwɛɛ bio, na mehunuu nwoma mmobɔeɛ a ɛretu wɔ ewiem wɔ mʼanim! <verse eid="ZEC 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2"/>Ɔbisaa me sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na wohunu yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:2">Mebuaa sɛ, “Mehunu nwoma mmobɔeɛ a ɛnenam ewiem a ne tenten yɛ anammɔn aduasa, na ne tɛtrɛtɛ nso yɛ anammɔn dunum.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Yei ne nnome a ɛreba asase yi so nyinaa; sɛdeɛ ɛfa baako kyerɛ no, wɔbɛpam ɔkorɔmfoɔ biara, na ɛfa baako nso kyerɛ sɛ, obiara a ɔka ntanhunu no, wɔbɛpam no. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> pae mu ka sɛ, ‘Meresoma nnome yi na ɛbɛhyɛn ɔkorɔmfoɔ ne obiara a ɔde me din ka ntanhunu no fie. Ɛbɛka efie hɔ na asɛe ne nnua ne aboɔ.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbaa A Ɔte Kɛntɛn Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ a na ɔne me rekasa no baa nʼanim bɛka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Ma wʼani so na hwɛ yei, deɛ ɛreba yi.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6"/>Mebisaa sɛ “Ɛyɛ ɛdeɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:6">Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ kɛntɛn a wɔde susu nneɛma.” Ɔtoaa so sɛ, “nnipa a wɔwɔ ewiase yi mu bɔne ahyɛ no ma.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7"/>Afei wɔyii kɛntɛn no so sumpii mmuasoɔ no, na emu na na ɔbaa bi hyɛ! <verse eid="ZEC 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8"/>Ɔkaa sɛ, “Yei yɛ atirimuɔdensɛm,” afei ɔkaa ɔbaa no hyɛɛ kɛntɛn no mu na ɔde sumpii mmuasoɔ no kataa no so.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9"/>Afei, memaa me tiri so mehunuu mmaa mmienu a wɔwɔ ntaban te sɛ asukɔnkɔn de danedane wɔn ho wɔ ewiem. Wɔmaa kɛntɛn no so kɔɔ ewiem, ɔsoro ne asase ntam.<verse eid="ZEC 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10"/>Mebisaa ɔbɔfoɔ a na ɔne me rekasa no sɛ, “Ɛhe na wɔde kɛntɛn no rekɔ?”<verse eid="ZEC 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11"/>Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Wɔde rekɔ Babilonia asase so akɔsi fie ama no. Na sɛ, wɔwie a, wɔde kɛntɛn no bɛkɔ akɔsi nʼafa.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Nteaseɛnam Ɛnan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1"/>Memaa mʼani so bio, na mehunuu nteaseɛnam ɛnan a ɛfiri mmepɔ mmienu ntam reba, mmepɔ no yɛ kɔbere mfrafraeɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2"/>Teaseɛnam a ɛdi ɛkan no, na apɔnkɔ kɔkɔɔ na ɛtwe, na apɔnkɔ tuntum nso twe deɛ ɛtɔ so mmienu no. <verse eid="ZEC 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3"/>Deɛ ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa no, na apɔnkɔ fitaa na ɛtwe. Deɛ ɛto so ɛnan no, na apɔnkɔ ntokontrama na ɛtwe, na apɔnkɔ no nyinaa ho yɛ den. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4"/>Mebisaa ɔbɔfoɔ a na ɔne me rekasa no sɛ, “Me wura, yeinom yɛ ɛdeɛn?”<verse eid="ZEC 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no buaa me sɛ, “Yeinom yɛ ahonhom ɛnan a wɔfiri soro, na wɔrefiri ewiase nyinaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no anim akɔ. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6"/>Teaseɛnam a apɔnkɔ tuntum retwe no rekɔ ɔman a ɛwɔ atifi fam no so. Teaseɛnam a apɔnkɔ fitaa retwe no rekɔ atɔeɛ fam; na deɛ apɔnkɔ ntokontrama twe no rekɔ anafoɔ fam.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7"/>Apɔnkɔ ahoɔdenfoɔ no firii adi no, wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔkɔ asase nyinaa so. Na ɔbɔfoɔ no kaa sɛ, “Monkɔ asase nyinaa so!” Enti wɔkɔɔ asase so mmaa nyinaa.<verse eid="ZEC 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8"/>Afei, ɔfrɛɛ me sɛ, “Hwɛ, wɔn a wɔrekɔ atifi fam ɔman so no ama me Honhom ahomegyeɛ wɔ atifi fam asase no so.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosua Ahenkyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn. Ɔkaa sɛ, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10"/>“Gye sikakɔkɔɔ ne dwetɛ firi atukɔfoɔ, Heldai, Tobia ne Yedaia a wɔfiri Babilonia aba no nkyɛn. Ɛda no ara kɔ Sefania babarima Yosia fie. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11"/>Gye dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ na fa yɛ ahenkyɛ, hyɛ ɔsɔfopanin Yosua a ɔyɛ Yehosadak babarima no ti. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12"/>Ka kyerɛ no sɛ, sei na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Ɔbarima a wɔfrɛ no Dubaa no nie, na ɔbɛfefɛ afiri hɔ akɔsi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13"/>Ɔno na ɔbɛsi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no, na wɔbɛhyɛ no animuonyam, na ɔbɛtena nʼahennwa so adi ne ɔhene, na ɔbɛyɛ ɔsɔfoɔ wɔ nʼahennwa so. Afei asomdwoeɛ bɛba mmienu no ntam.’ <verse eid="ZEC 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14"/>Wɔde ahenkyɛ no bɛma Heldai, Tobia, Yedaia ne Sefania babarima Hen, na wɔde ayɛ nkae adeɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan mu. <verse eid="ZEC 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15"/>Wɔn a wɔwɔ akyirikyiri no bɛba abɛboa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no si, na mobɛhunu sɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me mo nkyɛn. Sɛ moyɛ ɔsetie ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn nokorɛ mu a, yei bɛba mu.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Atɛntenenee Ne Ahummɔborɔ Na Ɛnyɛ Mmuadadie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1"/>Ɔhene Dario adedie mfeɛ ɛnan so no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Sakaria nkyɛn ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so nkron a wɔfrɛ no Kislew no ɛda ɛtɔ so ɛnan no mu. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2"/>Na Bet-Elfoɔ asoma Sareser ne Regem-Melek ne wɔn mmarima sɛ wɔnkɔsrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="ZEC 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3"/>Wɔmfa asɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fie ne adiyifoɔ so mmisa sɛ, “Menkɔ so ntwa adwo, nni abuada wɔ ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so enum no mu, sɛdeɛ mayɛ no mfeɛ bebree a atwam no anaa?”<verse eid="ZEC 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4"/>Afei Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5"/>“Bisa asase no so nnipa nyinaa ne asɔfoɔ no sɛ, ‘Mfeɛ aduɔson a atwam no, sɛ modi abuada na motwa adwo wɔ abosome enum ne nsom mu a, na ɛyɛ ampa sɛ me enti na modi abuada no anaa? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6"/>Ɛberɛ a modidi na monom no, na ɛnyɛ mo ara na moyɛ de gye mo ani anaa? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7"/>Ɛnyɛ saa nsɛm yi ara na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> faa kane adiyifoɔ so paee mu kaaeɛ, wɔ ɛberɛ a Yerusalem ne nkuro a atwa ne ho ahyia no wɔ asomdwoeɛ ne mpontuo no, ɛberɛ a na nnipa akɔtena Negeb ne atɔeɛ fam nkokoɔ no so anaa?’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Sakaria nkyɛn bio: <verse eid="ZEC 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9"/>“Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ, ‘Mommu atɛn a ɛyɛ nokorɛ na monnya ahummɔborɔ ne ayamhyehyeɛ mma mo ho mo ho. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10"/>Monnhyɛ akunafoɔ, nwisiaa, ahɔhoɔ ne ahiafoɔ so. Monnnwene bɔne mo akoma mu mma mo ho mo ho.’<verse eid="ZEC 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11"/>“Nanso wɔanntie; wɔde asobrakyeɛ danee wɔn akyi na wɔsisii wɔn aso. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12"/>Wɔyɛɛ wɔn akoma den sɛ twerɛboɔ, na wɔantie mmara anaa nsɛm a Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam ne Honhom so de somaa kane adiyifoɔ no. Ɛno enti, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu yie.<verse eid="ZEC 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13"/>“ ‘Mefrɛeɛ no, wɔannye me so, enti wɔfrɛ a merennye wɔn so,’ sɛdeɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14"/>‘Mede ntwahoframa bɔɔ wɔn petee aman nyinaa so ma wɔkɔyɛɛ ahɔhoɔ wɔ hɔ. Asase a wogyaaɛ no daa mpan a obiara ntwa mu wɔ hɔ. Sei na wɔyɛ maa asase fɛfɛɛfɛ no sɛeɛ.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Hyɛ Bɔ Sɛ Ɔbɛhyira Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn bio. <verse eid="ZEC 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: “Metwe Sion ho ninkunu pa ara; metwe ne ho ninkunu anibereɛ so.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3"/>Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie, “Mɛsane akɔ Sion na makɔtena Yerusalem. Afei wɔbɛfrɛ Yerusalem Nokorɛ Kuropɔn, na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bepɔ no, wɔbɛfrɛ no Bepɔ Kronkron.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Nkɔkoraa ne mmerewa bɛtenatena Yerusalem mmɔntene so bio a obiara kura poma, ɛsiane onyini enti. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5"/>Na mmarimaa ne mmaayewa a wɔredi agorɔ bɛhyɛ kuropɔn no mmɔntene so ma.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Nkaeɛfoɔ yi deɛ, ɛbɛyɛ wɔn nwanwa saa ɛberɛ no, na me nso ɛbɛyɛ me nwanwa anaa?”<verse eid="ZEC 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Mɛgye me nkurɔfoɔ afiri aman a ɛwɔ apueeɛ ne atɔeɛ no so. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8"/>Mede wɔn bɛsane aba abɛtena Yerusalem; wɔbɛyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ, na mayɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn wɔ nokorɛ ne tenenee mu.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Mo a afei na morete nsɛm a adiyifoɔ no kaeɛ no; adiyifoɔ a na wɔwɔ hɔ ɛberɛ a wɔtoo Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fie fapem no, monhyɛ mo ho den, na moatumi asi asɔredan no. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10"/>Ɛberɛ no nnya nsoeɛ no, na wɔntua apaadie ho ka mma nnipa anaa mmoa. Atamfoɔ enti, na obiara ntumi nkɔ nʼadwuma so asomdwoeɛ mu, ɛfiri sɛ na mede mpaapaemu aba wɔn mu. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11"/>Nanso, afei deɛ, merenyɛ nkaeɛfoɔ yi sɛdeɛ meyɛɛ kane no,” sɛdeɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12"/>“Aba no bɛnyini yie, bobe bɛso nʼaba, asase no bɛbɔ nʼaduane na ɔsoro nso bɛtɔ ne bosuo. Mede saa nneɛma yi nyinaa bɛma nkaeɛfoɔ yi sɛ wɔn agyapadeɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13"/>Mo, Yuda ne Israel, moayɛ nnome wɔ aman no mu, nanso mɛgye mo na moayɛ nhyira. Monnsuro, na monhyɛ mo ho den.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Sɛdeɛ meyɛɛ mʼadwene sɛ mede atoyerɛnkyɛm bɛba mo so, na mannya ahummɔborɔ ɛberɛ a mo agyanom fuu me bo no, <verse eid="ZEC 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15"/>saa ara na afei mayɛ mʼadwene sɛ, mɛyɛ Yerusalem ne Yuda yie. Monnsuro. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16"/>Deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ nie: Monni mo ho mo ho nokorɛ. Mommu atɛntenenee wɔ mo asɛnniiɛ; <verse eid="ZEC 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17"/>mommmɔ po bɔne ntia mo ho mo ho, na monnnɔ ntam hunu. Mekyiri saa nneɛma yi nyinaa,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn bio. <verse eid="ZEC 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Abosome ɛnan, enum, nson ne edu mu mmuadadie no bɛyɛ anigyeɛ ne ahosɛpɛ mmerɛ, na ɛbɛyɛ anigyeɛ afahyɛ ama Yuda. Enti monnɔ nokorɛ ne asomdwoeɛ.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie, “Nnipa bebree ne wɔn a wɔtete nkuropɔn bebree so bɛba ara, <verse eid="ZEC 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21"/>na nnipa a wɔfiri kuropɔn baako so bɛkɔ foforɔ so akɔka sɛ, ‘Momma yɛnkɔ seesei ara nkɔsrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na yɛnhwehwɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Me deɛ, merekɔ.’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22"/>Na nnipa bebree ne aman akɛseɛ bɛba Yerusalem abɛhwehwɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no, na wɔakoto asrɛ no.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Nna no mu, nnipa edu a wɔka kasa ahodoɔ na wɔfiri aman ahodoɔ so bɛba abɛsɔ Yudani atadeɛ mmuano mu na wɔbɛka sɛ, ‘Wo ne yɛn nkɔ, ɛfiri sɛ yɛate sɛ Onyankopɔn ka wo ho.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 8:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Atemmuo A Ɛtia Israel Atamfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1"/>Nkɔmhyɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ZEC 9:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm tia Hadrak asase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">na ɛbɛka Damasko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">ɛfiri sɛ, nnipa ne Israel mmusuakuo nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">ani wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> so.<verse eid="ZEC 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2"/>Na ɛbɛka Hamat a ɔne no bɔ hyeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:2">ɛbɛka Tiro ne Sidon, ɛwom sɛ wɔyɛ anyansafoɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3"/>Tiro asi abandenden ama ne ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">waboa dwetɛ ano te sɛ mfuturo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">ne sikakɔkɔɔ ano te sɛ dɔteɛ a ɛwɔ mmɔntene so.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4"/>Nanso, Awurade bɛgye nʼahodeɛ nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">na wasɛe ne tumi a ɔwɔ wɔ ɛpo so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">na wɔde ogya bɛhye no dworobɛɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5"/>Askelon bɛhunu na wasuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gasa de ɔyea bɛnukanuka ne mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">na Ekron nso saa ara, ɛfiri sɛ nʼanidasoɔ bɛsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gasa bɛhwere ne ɔhene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">na wɔbɛgya Askelon afituo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Askelon…Gasa…Ekron: Filistifoɔ nkuropɔn mmiɛnsa. Nʼanidasoɔ bɛsa: Ɛsiane sɛ Ekron da Filistiman atifi pɛɛ enti, ɛno na ɛbɛdi ɛkan ahunu amane. Nʼanidasoɔ sɛ Tiro bɛgyina mu ama no ɔhaw anaa abɛbrɛsɛ bi mu no nkɔsi hwee so.</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6"/>Ananafoɔ bɛtena Asdod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:6">na mɛtwa Filistifoɔ ahantan agu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7"/>Mɛyi mogya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mogya—Ɛgyina hɔ ma abosom afɔrebɔ. Akyiwadeɛ nnuane—Nnapɔnna nnuane a ɛho nteɛ. Yebusifoɔ—Nnipa bi a wɔtenaa Yerusalem tete berɛ mu a wɔbɛfraa Yudafoɔ mu. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 24:16-24">2 Sam 24.16-24</ref></char>).</char></note> afiri wɔn ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">akyiwadeɛ nnuane nso mɛyi afiri wɔn ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Nkaeɛfoɔ no bɛyɛ yɛn Onyankopɔn dea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">wɔbɛyɛ Yuda ntuanofoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">na Ekron bɛyɛ sɛ Yebusifoɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8"/>Nanso mɛbɔ me Fie ho ban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">wɔ wɔn a wɔtetɛ bɔ korɔno ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Ɔhyɛsofoɔ biara ntumi mfa me nkurɔfoɔ so bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">ɛfiri sɛ afei merewɛn.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sion Ɔhene Ba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9"/>Di ahurisie Ao, Ɔbabaa Sion!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Team, Ɔbabaa Yerusalem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Hwɛ, wo ɔhene reba wo nkyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Ɔtene na ɔwɔ nkwagyeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">ɔdwo, na ɔte afunumu so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">afunumu ba so na ɔteɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10"/>Mɛgye nteaseɛnam afiri Efraim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">ne akofoɔ apɔnkɔ afiri Yerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">na akodie tadua no wɔbɛbubu mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Ɔbɛpae mu aka asomdwoeɛ nsɛm akyerɛ aman no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">Nʼahennie bɛfiri ɛpo akɔka ɛpo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">ɛbɛfiri Asubɔnten no akɔpem nsase ano.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11"/>Na wo deɛ, ɛsiane me ne wo mogya apam no enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">mɛyi wo nneduafoɔ afiri amena a nsuo nni mu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12"/>Monsane nkɔ mʼaban mu, Ao nneduafoɔ a mowɔ anidasoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">seesei mpo merebɔ mo nkaeɛ sɛ mɛhyɛ mo anan mu mmɔho.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13"/>Mɛkoa Yuda sɛdeɛ mekoa me tadua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">na mede Efraim bɛhyɛ mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Mɛkanyane wo mmammarima, Ao Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">atia wo Hela mmammarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">na mɛyɛ wo sɛ ɔkofoɔ akofena.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛda ne ho adi wɔn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">nʼagyan bɛtwa yerɛ te sɛ anyinam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛhyɛn totorobɛnto no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">ɔbɛbɔ nsra wɔ atɔeɛ fam ahum mu,<verse eid="ZEC 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛyɛ ɛkyɛm ama wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">Wɔde ahwimmoɔ bɛsɛe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">na wɔde adi nkonim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Wɔbɛnom na wɔabobɔ mu sɛdeɛ wɔanom nsã;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">wɔbɛyɛ ma te sɛ kuruwa a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">wɔde pete afɔrebukyia ntweaso.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔn Onyankopɔn, bɛgye wɔn saa ɛda no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">sɛ odwanhwɛfoɔ gye ne nnwan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Wɔbɛtwa nyinam nyinam wɔ nʼasase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">sɛ aboɔdemmoɔ a ɛbobɔ ahenkyɛ ho.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17"/>Sɛdeɛ wɔn ho bɛtwa na wɔn ho ayɛ fɛ afa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">Aduane bɛma mmeranteɛ anyini ahoɔden so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">na nsã foforɔ bɛma mmabaawa anyini saa ara.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Bɛhwɛ Yudafoɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1"/>Mommisa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ nsuo osutɔberɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔyɛ osutɔ mframa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Ɔma osuo tɔ ma nnipa nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">ne mfudeɛ nso ma obiara.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2"/>Ahoni no ka nnaadaasɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">nkɔmhyɛfoɔ nya anisoadehunu a ɛyɛ atorɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">wɔde nkontomposɛm kyerɛ daeɛ ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">wɔma awerɛkyekyerɛ kwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Enti nnipa no nenam te sɛ nnwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">a wɔnni ɔhwɛfoɔ na wɔhyɛ wɔn so.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3"/>“Mebo afu nnwanhwɛfoɔ no yie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">na mɛtwe ntuanofoɔ no aso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">Na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛhwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">ne nnwankuo a wɔyɛ Yuda fie no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">na wayɛ wɔn sɛ animuonyam pɔnkɔ wɔ ɔsa mu.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4"/>Tweatiboɔ bɛfiri Yuda mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">na ntomadan pɛɛwa bɛfiri hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">ɔsa mu tadua bɛfiri Yuda mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">na sodifoɔ nyinaa nso saa ara.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5"/>Wɔbɛbɔ mu ayɛ sɛ nnɔmmarima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">a wɔtiatia mmorɔno so atakyɛ mu wɔ ɔko mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Esiane sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka wɔn ho no enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">wɔbɛko na wɔadi apɔnkɔsotefoɔ no so.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6"/>“Mɛhyɛ Yuda fie den</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">na magye Yosef fie no nkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Mede wɔn bɛsi wɔn dada mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">ɛfiri sɛ me yam hyehye me wɔ wɔn ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Wɔbɛyɛ te sɛ deɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">mempoo wɔn mpo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">na me ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔn Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">na mɛgye wɔn so.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7"/>Efraimfoɔ bɛyɛ sɛ nnɔmmarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">wɔn ani bɛgye te sɛ deɛ wɔanom nsã.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Wɔn mma bɛhunu na wɔn ani bɛgye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">wɔbɛdi ahurisi wɔ wɔn akoma mu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mu.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8"/>Meto nsa afrɛ wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">aboaboa wɔn ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">Ampa ara megye wɔn bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">wɔbɛdɔɔso sɛ kane no.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9"/>Ɛwom sɛ mɛhwete wɔn mu akɔ aman so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">nanso wɔbɛkae me wɔ akyirikyiri nsase so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Wɔne wɔn mma bɛtena nkwa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">na wɔbɛsane aba.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10"/>Mede wɔn bɛfiri Misraim aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">mɛboa wɔn ano afiri Asiria.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Mede wɔn bɛba Gilead ne Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">na wɔrensene hɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11"/>Wɔbɛfa ɛpo mu ɔhaw ne abɛbrɛsɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">nanso wɔbɛma ɛpo asorɔkye no atae dinn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Nil mu nsuo nyinaa bɛwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">Asiria ahomasoɔ nso wɔbɛbrɛ no ase</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">na Misraim ahempoma bɛtwam.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12"/>Mɛhyɛ wɔn den wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">na ne din mu na wɔbɛnante,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1"/>Buebue wʼapono, Ao Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:1">na ogya mmɛhye wo ntweneduro!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2"/>Twa adwo wo pepeaa, na ntweneduro ahwe ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">wɔasɛe nnua a ɛwɔ animuonyam no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Twa adwo Basan adum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">wɔabubu kwaeɛbirentuo no mu nnua no!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3"/>Tie nnwanhwɛfoɔ agyaadwoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">wɔasɛe wɔn adidibea frɔmfrɔm no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Tie agyata no mmobom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">Yordan ho nkyɛkyerɛ fɛfɛ no asɛe!<verse eid="ZEC 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnwanhwɛfoɔ Mmienu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> me Onyankopɔn seɛ: “Fa nnwankuo a wɔrebɛku wɔn no kɔ adidibea. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5"/>Atɔfoɔ no kunkumm nnwan no na wɔntwe wɔn aso. Wɔn a wɔtɔn nnwan no ka sɛ, ‘Monkamfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mayɛ ɔdefoɔ!’ Na nnwan no ahwɛfoɔ no mpo nnya ahummɔborɔ mma wɔn. <verse eid="ZEC 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6"/>Merenhunu asase no so nnipa mmɔbɔ bio,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie. “Mede obiara bɛhyɛ ne yɔnko ne ɔhene nsa. Wɔbɛhyɛ asase no so, na merennye obiara mfiri wɔn nsa mu.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7"/>Enti mede nnwankuo a wɔrekɔkum wɔn no kɔɔ adidibea, ne titire ne wɔn a wɔayɛ mmɔbɔ no. Afei, mefaa poma mmienu, na mefrɛɛ baako Adɔeɛ ɛnna baako nso Nkabom na mede wɔn kɔɔ adidie. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8"/>Ɔbosome baako mu, mepamoo nnwanhwɛfoɔ mmiɛnsa no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 11:8">Nnwankuo no ampɛ me, na wɔmaa me brɛeɛ <verse eid="ZEC 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9"/>na mekaa sɛ, “Merenyɛ mo hwɛfoɔ bio. Wɔn a wɔrewu nwu, na wɔn a wɔreyera nso nyera. Na ma wɔn a aka no nso nkyekye wɔn ho wɔn ho nwe.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10"/>Afei, mefaa me poma a mefrɛ no Adɔeɛ no bubuu mu de sɛee apam a me ne aman no nyinaa ayɛ no. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11"/>Wɔsɛee no ɛda no ara, na wɔn a wɔrehunu amane wɔ nnwankuo no mu a na wɔrehwɛ me no hunuu sɛ, ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm.<verse eid="ZEC 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12"/>Na meka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Sɛ ɛbɛyɛ yie a, montua me ka, na sɛ ɛnte saa nso a, momma ɛntena hɔ.” Enti, wɔtuaa dwetɛ mpɔ aduasa maa me.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dwetɛ mpɔ aduasa—Tete hɔ no, saa na na Israelfoɔ tɔ nkoa.</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “To ma ɔnwomfoɔ no,” ɛboɔ a ɛsɔ ani a wɔatwa ama me no. Enti, mefaa dwetɛ mpɔ aduasa no, na meto maa ɔnwomfoɔ a ɔwɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fie mu no.<verse eid="ZEC 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14"/>Afei, mebuu me poma a ɛtɔ so mmienu a wɔfrɛ no Nkabom no mu, de sɛee onuayɛ a ɛda Yuda ne Israel ntam no.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Fa odwanhwɛfoɔ kwasea no nneɛma no bio. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16"/>Na merebɛma odwanhwɛfoɔ bi asɔre asase no so a ɔrenhwehwɛ deɛ wayera. Ɔrempɛ nnwammaa akyiri ɛkwan, ɔrensa deɛ wapira yadeɛ, ɔremma deɛ ɔwɔ ahoɔden aduane, na mmom, ɔbɛwe nnwan a wadɔre no nam, na watwitwa wɔn tɔte.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17"/>“Nnome nka odwanhwɛfoɔ a ne ho nni mfasoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">na ɔdwane gya nnwankuo no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Akofena ntwa nʼabasa, ne nʼani nifa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">Nʼabasa no nwu koraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">na nʼani nifa no mfira koraa!”<verse eid="ZEC 11:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɛsɛe Yerusalem Atamfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1"/>Nkɔmhyɛ: Yei ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɛfa Israel ho.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ZEC 12:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 12:1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔtrɛ ɔsoro mu, deɛ ɔto asase fapem, deɛ ɔyɛ honhom a ɔte onipa mu asɛm nie: <verse eid="ZEC 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2"/>“Merebɛyɛ Yerusalem kuruwa a ɛbɛma aman a atwa ne ho ahyia no atɔ ntintan. Wɔbɛto ahyɛ Yuda ne Yerusalem so. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3"/>Saa ɛda no a ewiase aman nyinaa aboa wɔn ho ano retia no no, mɛma Yerusalem ayɛ ɔbotantim ama aman no nyinaa. Wɔn a wɔbɛpɛ sɛ wopire no no nyinaa bɛpirapira wɔn ho. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4"/>Saa ɛda no, mɛma ɔpɔnkɔ biara abɔ huboa, na mɛma ne sotefoɔ nso abɔ dam,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie. “Mɛbue mʼani ahwɛ Yuda fie, na mɛfirafira aman ahodoɔ no apɔnkɔ ani. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5"/>Na Yuda ntuanofoɔ bɛka wɔ wɔn akoma mu sɛ, ‘Yerusalemfoɔ yɛ ahoɔdenfoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn.’<verse eid="ZEC 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6"/>“Saa ɛda no, mɛyɛ Yuda ntuanofoɔ sɛ ogya ayowaa a ɛhyɛ nnyina mu, te sɛ ogyatɛn a ɛrederɛ wɔ wira a wɔaboa ano mu. Wɔbɛhye nnipa a wɔatwa wɔn ho ahyia nyinaa wɔ benkum ne nifa, nanso hwee renka Yerusalem wɔ baabi a ɔwɔ hɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ Yuda atenaeɛ ho ban kane, sɛdeɛ Dawid fie ne wɔn a wɔte Yerusalem animuonyam renkyɛne Yudafoɔ animuonyam. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8"/>Saa ɛda no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ wɔn a wɔte Yerusalem ho ban, deɛ ɔyɛ mmerɛ koraa wɔ wɔn mu no bɛyɛ sɛ Dawid. Na Dawid asefoɔ bɛyɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn, te sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Bɔfoɔ a ɔdi wɔn anim. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9"/>Saa ɛda no, mɛhyɛ aseɛ asɛe aman a wɔko tia Yerusalem nyinaa.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wotwa Adwo Ma Deɛ Wɔhwiree No No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10"/>“Mehwie adom ne nkotosrɛ honhom agu Dawid fie ne wɔn a wɔte Yerusalem so. Wɔbɛhwɛ me a wɔahwire me, na wɔatwa adwo ama no te sɛ obi a ɔretwa adwo wɔ ɔba korɔ ho, na wɔasu yaaya te sɛ obi a ɔresu ne ba barima piesie. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11"/>Saa ɛda no agyaadwo twerɛ a ɛwɔ Yerusalem no ano bɛyɛ den te sɛ Hadad-Rimon agyaadwo twerɛ wɔ Megido asase tam so. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12"/>Asase no sofoɔ nyinaa bɛdi awerɛhoɔ, abusua biara ne wɔn yerenom; Dawid fie abusua ne wɔn yerenom, Natan fie abusua ne wɔn yerenom, <verse eid="ZEC 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13"/>Lewifie abusua ne wɔn yerenom, Simei abusua ne wɔn yerenom, <verse eid="ZEC 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14"/>ne mmusua a aka no nyinaa ne wɔn yerenom.<verse eid="ZEC 12:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Bɔne Ho Ahodwira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1"/>“Saa ɛda no, wɔbɛtu asubura ama Dawid fie ne Yerusalemfoɔ de ahohoro wɔn bɔne ne wɔn ho fi.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2"/>“Saa ɛda no, mɛyi ahoni no din afiri asase no so, na wɔrenkae wɔn bio,” sɛdeɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie. “Mɛyi adiyifoɔ ne efiyɛ honhom afiri asase no so. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3"/>Sɛ obi kɔ so hyɛ nkɔm a, agya ne ɛna a wɔwoo saa onipa no bɛka akyerɛ no sɛ, ‘Ɛsɛ sɛ wowuo, ɛfiri sɛ, wode <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din atwa atorɔ.’ Sɛ ɔhyɛ nkɔm a, ɔno ankasa awofoɔ bɛwɔ no sekan.<verse eid="ZEC 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4"/>“Saa ɛda no, odiyifoɔ biara ani bɛwu wɔ ne nkɔmhyɛ anisoadehunu ho. Ɔrenhyɛ odiyifoɔ atadeɛ a wɔde nwi ayɛ, mfa nnaadaa nnipa. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5"/>Ɔbɛka sɛ, ‘Menyɛ odiyifoɔ. Meyɛ okuafoɔ. Na ɛfiri me mmeranteberɛ mu no, asase yi so na menya mʼano aduane.’ <verse eid="ZEC 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6"/>Na sɛ obi bisa no sɛ, ‘Ɛdeɛn akuro na ɛwɔ wo ho yi a?’ Ɔbɛbua sɛ, ‘Ɛyɛ akuro a menyaa wɔ me nnamfonom fie.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Odwanhwɛfoɔ No, Na Nnwan No Hwete</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7"/>“Sɔre, Ao, akofena, sɔre tia me dwanhwɛfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">tia onipa a ɔbɛn me!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">Sɛdeɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">“Bɔ odwanhwɛfoɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">na nnwan no bɛbɔ ahwete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">na mɛma me nsa so atia nnwammaa no.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8"/>Asase no so nyinaa,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">“Wɔbɛbɔ nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu mmienu ahwe fam ma wɔawuwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">na nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako bɛka wɔ so.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9"/>Mede nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako yi bɛfa ogya mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">mɛnane wɔn te sɛ deɛ wɔnane dwetɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">na masɔne wɔn so sɛ sikakɔkɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Wɔbɛbɔ me din afrɛ me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">na mɛgye wɔn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Mɛka sɛ, ‘Wɔyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">na wɔbɛka sɛ, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ yɛn Onyankopɔn.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 13:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Bɛba Abɛdi Ɔhene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɛda bi reba a, wɔbɛkyɛ mo afodeɛ wɔ mo mu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2"/>Mɛboaboa aman no nyinaa ano abɛko atia Yerusalem; wɔbɛko afa kuropɔn no, wɔbɛwia afie mu nneɛma, na wɔato mmaa no monnaa. Wɔbɛfa kuropɔn no mu nnipa no mu fa akɔ nnommum mu, nanso nkaeɛfoɔ no bɛka kuropɔn no mu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛkɔ akɔko atia saa aman no, sɛdeɛ ɔko ɔko da no. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4"/>Saa ɛda no, ɔde nʼanammɔn bɛsisi Ngo Bepɔ a ɛwɔ Yerusalem apueeɛ fam no so, na Ngo Bepɔ no mu bɛpae mmienu afiri apueeɛ fam akɔsi atɔeɛ fam na ayɛ bɔnhwa kɛseɛ. Ɛbɛma bepɔ no fa akɔ atifi fam, na ɛfa nso akɔ anafoɔ fam. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5"/>Mobɛdwane afa me bɔnhwa no mu, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛkɔsi Asel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asal—Ɛyɛ kuro bi a ɛda Yerusalem apueeɛ fam a ɛno na ɛkyerɛ baabi a bɔnhwa foforɔ no ano si.</char></note> Mobɛdwane, sɛdeɛ moyɛɛ no ɛberɛ a asase wosooɛ wɔ Yudahene Usia berɛ so no. Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, me Onyankopɔn bɛba a ahotefoɔ nyinaa ka ne ho.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6"/>Saa ɛda no, hann, awɔ ne nsukyeneeɛ remma. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7"/>Ɛbɛyɛ ɛda soronko a ɛnni awiaberɛ anaa anadwo, ɛda a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔnim. Onwunu bɛdwoɔ no na hann wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8"/>Saa ɛda no, nkwa nsuo bɛtene afiri Yerusalem. Ɛfa bɛkɔ apueeɛ ɛpo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɛno ne Nkyene Po</char></note> mu, na ɛfa akɔ atɔeɛ ɛpo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɛno ne Ntam Po</char></note> mu, ahuhuro ne awɔ berɛ mu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛdi ɔhene wɔ asase nyinaa so. Saa ɛda no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛyɛ baako na ne din nso ayɛ baako pɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10"/>Asase a ɛfiri Geba kɔsi Rimon a ɛda Yerusalem anafoɔ fam nyinaa bɛyɛ asase tamaa sɛ Araba. Nanso, wɔbɛma Yerusalem so ama nnipa atena hɔ afiri Benyamin Ɛpono akɔsi Ɛpono A Ɛdi Ɛkan, de akɔsi Ntweasoɔ Ɛpono ne Hananel Abantenten de akɔsi ɔhene no nsakyimena no ho. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11"/>Nnipa bɛtena mu, na wɔrensɛe no bio. Yerusalem bɛnya asomdwoeɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12"/>Yei ne ɔyaredɔm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de bɛbɔ aman a wɔko tiaa Yerusalem no. Wɔn honam bɛporɔ ɛberɛ a wɔgyina wɔn nan so. Wɔn anikosua bɛporɔ wɔ wɔn ntokuro mu, na wɔn tɛkrɛma bɛporɔ wɔ wɔn anomu. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13"/>Saa ɛda no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma nnipa abɔ huboa, na wɔbɛtwa wɔn ho ako. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14"/>Yuda nso bɛko wɔ Yerusalem. Wɔbɛfa aman a atwa ahyia hɔ no nyinaa ahonyadeɛ a ɛyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ, dwetɛ ne aduradeɛ bebree. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15"/>Saa ɔyaredɔm korɔ yi ara bɛka apɔnkɔ, mfunumpɔnkɔ, nyoma, mfunumu ne mmoa a aka a wɔwɔ atamfoɔ nsraban mu nyinaa.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16"/>Afei wɔn a wɔbɛka wɔ aman a wɔko tiaa Yerusalem no nyinaa bɛkɔ akɔsom Ɔhene no, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no afe biara, na wɔadi Asese Afahyɛ no. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17"/>Sɛ ewiase mu nnipa bi ankɔ Yerusalem ankɔsom Ɔhene no, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no a, osuo rentɔ mma wɔn. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18"/>Sɛ Misraimfoɔ ankɔ hɔ ankɔhyɛ fa no bi a, osuo rentɔ mma wɔn. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ɔyaredɔm a ɔma ɛba aman a wɔnnkɔ Asese Afahyɛ no so no bɛbɔ wɔn. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19"/>Yei bɛyɛ asotwe ama Misraim ne aman a wɔnnkɔ Asese Afahyɛ no nyinaa.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20"/>Saa ɛda no, wɔbɛkrukyire asɛm a ɛka sɛ: KRONKRON MA <char style="nd">Awurade</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">KRONKRON MA <char style="nd">Awurade:</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yei yɛ nsɛm a wɔatwa agu sikakɔkɔɔ apaawa so de abɔ ɔsɔfopanin no abotire anim (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 28:36-38">2 Mose 28.36-38</ref></char>) a ɛde kae no sɛ wɔayɛ no kronkron ama Awurade adwumayɛ.</char></note> wɔ adɔmma a ɛsensɛn apɔnkɔ kɔn mu ho, na nkukuo a wɔde noa aduane wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fie no bɛyɛ sɛ nkuruwa kronkron a ɛsisi afɔrebukyia anim. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21"/>Kukuo biara a ɛwɔ Yerusalem ne Yuda bɛyɛ deɛ wɔate ho ama Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na wɔn a wɔba bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ nyinaa bɛfa nkukuo yi bi anoa mu. Na saa ɛda no, wɔrenhunu Kanaanni wɔ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fie bio.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14"/>
</usx>
